   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves in the xy-plane with velocity vector \\( v(t) = \\left\\langle 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{4} \\right)}, 4 \\sqrt{t} e^{- \\frac{t}{2}} \\right\\rangle \\) for \\( t \\ge 0 \\). At time \\( t = 3 \\) the particle is at the point \\( (-1, 1) \\). Using a calculator, find the x-coordinate of the particle's position at time \\( t = 1 \\). Show the setup for the calculations, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
